      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `9f4852c0cfa3c6cfe5329edc1cbb8fa2a79358ae007c0a4943363d7a828becee--45130do007_200708.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2007-08\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d99e2ae605a0277b39baa73827eb82ea59025485b65b44375e9c357777f45e0b | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 745434bbbaac425eda7b334a6e319b938d293e40428adbeb34c4eda6462f9ddb | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | b9b8c016d9a41a890cd9c788ace3f6388c118b0059988ffda8b484e557bb0681 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | fe8d6cb582bae5b1916d19a2d16cacf94931dd09d249b137e2fe8532a83f2a92 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 739770ba9c89dc05c94d75d894f3f53dd710d5daec8d1109230c8df8007785e8 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 8c90f3fcdda24a0b4e9299a1f0776c5f77827cf027ac70e1610926a1f5e17b47 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 5ab7bf415e0a8608254a7b9ca55e005bffcd86b0fff1e16cee93ebc165a5906d | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | a157d6bcd63c93d18b9b6bbe17d823ddece7fdcf48b68765549a368b03707cf3 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | ecd26a057c0c42b7e261f222b03c2f05eefa87db14c8ddba6f7e7336e9138353 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 2c4e27ffa23ee3feb68072addb051e9b726ed159be545f808c60cb1bb1321048 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 22479fe5c90e442f7215a47bc4d3fb3abc3c754db5257bc74a4105ebe7ef1037 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 9ed801721f17d890bce3e966951dd0fcc23f1e319ad5e760d8803472371a85e9 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 466df11d22137bc112988fc31ba2132200da0c42b534ccf2e7bbbd0ffadc8fb8 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 6b14701d47c5a4566d3f1c9160b5ad4117364c839913f035e69111db2e46a662 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | d35aab2daaa2d0f83c7fc48eb0d0a7dee084f1f319bf291c85add09f3154bef5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and che